   "body": "Done in #530 (merged as 82fc417).\n- **Left by design, with reasons in the PR:** `AccountsModelTests:129` (a bounded negative wait: a second restore must *not* reach the checker), the SwiftUI layout polls in `AppThemeTests:31` and `ListDensityLayoutTests:47` (no completion signal exists), and the WKWebView / loopback waits in the Reader tests. These narrow this issue's \"no yield loop\" criterion; I wrote the criterion, and this comment records the narrowing.\n- **Possible follow-up (CodeRabbit nitpick on #530):** gate an autosave before `DraftStore`, so that a refactor that clears the handle without awaiting it is also caught.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
